                            	  5124:     ; Animation frame 1 uses Wallmaster frame image 1, which
                            	  5125:     ; uses tiles $9C/$9D on the left and $9E/$9F on the right.
                            	  5126:     ; The right side is correctly the right side of a closed hand.
                            	  5127:     ; But the left side is Keese. So, we have to patch the left
                            	  5128:     ; side to use the common left side of the hand -- $AC/$AD.
