                            	 10817: ; Description:
                            	 10818: ; This block applies to heads and the bottom segment of a neck.
                            	 10819: ; These are drawn with sprites that come first in order, so that
                            	 10820: ; they are drawn above all other sprites, including Link.
                            	 10821: ;
