                            	  7938: __far_z_05_0097:
                            	  7939:     ; Shift right. The value in A is now (menu scroll value) / 2,
                            	  7940:     ; and represents the current row of the submenu being processed.
                            	  7941:     ; The bottom bit tells us (1) whether to transfer a full row of
                            	  7942:     ; black tiles, or (0) a row of the triforce or other piece of the GUI.
                            	  7943:     ;
                            	  7944:     ; If the bottom bit is set, go prepare the full black row.
                            	  7945:     ;
