02:0004C07A 6402            	  4926:     bcc  _L_z07_DrawSwordShotOrMagicShot_WriteSprites
                            	  4927:     even
                            	  4928: _L_z07_DrawSwordShotOrMagicShot_WriteMagicSprites:
