                            	  5642:     even
                            	  5643: _L_z07_CheckState30_SetState40:
                            	  5644:     ; Set state $40, and a time to move of $20 frames.
                            	  5645:     ;
                            	  5646:     ; In major state $40, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $50.
                            	  5647:     ;
                            	  5648:     ; Also, animate, draw, and handle any collision (with Link, if a monster's boomerang).
                            	  5649:     ;
