                            	  5786: AnimateBoomerangAndCheckCollision:
                            	  5787:     ; Decrement animation counter; and when it reaches 0:
                            	  5788:     ; 1. arm it again for 2 frames
                            	  5789:     ; 2. advance the minor state within a cycle of 8
                            	  5790:     ; 3. see if it's time to play the sound effect, if the boomerang belongs to Link
                            	  5791:     ;
